            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni agba ma juketho pa Yehova, m’ebilwong’o ya ubed ni cokri ma leng’, kara juthier lam ma jutimo ku mac ni Yehova, lam m’awang’a, man lam mi mogo, man lam, ku lam m’amadha, kubang’e kubang’e i cenge ma dhe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umed sabatu pa Yehova, man umed giramia mu, man umed lembang’ola mu ceke, man umed girathiera mu ceke ma ku berocwiny, ma wumio ni Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento i ceng’ mir apar wi abije i dwi mir abirone, kinde ma wucoko nying’ ng’om, wubikwiro agba pa Yehova ceng’ abiro: ceng’ ma kwong’ane bibedo yom ma cu, man ceng’ mir aborane bibedo yom ma cu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wubigamu iwu nying yen ma ber i ceng’ ma kwong’ane, ku jang thith, man jang yen ma dit, ku mbegu m’i kulo; e anyong’a binegowu i wang’ Yehova Mungu mu ceng’ abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wubikwire ni agba ni Yehova ceng’ abiro i rundi: e en e cik mi nja cil kum dhanum’utuk mu; wubikwire i dwi mir abirone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubibedo i otbak ceng’ abiro; dhanu m’anyola ceke ma kind Israel bibedo i otbak; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara dhanum’utuk mu ng’ei nia aketho nyithindho mir Israel ubedo i otbak, kinde m’awodhogi kud i ng’om Misiri: an a Yehova Mungu mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa yero ni nyithindho mir Israel pir agba pa Yehova ma juketho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
